{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1442"},"reason":"The 823-word sentence was stated as an exact count. 823 is the figure usually quoted (e.g. Prime Curios), but a count of Hugo's French text (Project Gutenberg, Tome IV, livre 1, ch. 3 'Louis-Philippe') gives about 760 space-separated words, or about 810 with elisions counted separately. The body now says the sentence is 'usually counted at 823 words' and names it as the portrait of Louis-Philippe; the notes explain the counting.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://t5k.org/curios/page.php/823.html"},{"url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/cache/epub/17518/pg17518.txt"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",254],["+","– a portrait "],["=",2],["+","King Louis-Philippe – usually counted at "],["=",2],["-","words,"],["+","words"],["=",1],["+","and "],["=",769]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",240],["-","von"],["+","–"],["=",1],["-","823"],["+","ein"],["=",1],["-","Wörtern,"],["+","Porträt"],["=",1],["+","König Louis-Philippes –, "],["=",2],["+","meist mit 823 Wörtern angegeben wird und "],["=",741]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",194],["-","из"],["+","–"],["=",1],["+","портрет короля Луи-Филиппа, – длину которого обычно называют в "],["=",2],["-","слов,"],["+","слова"],["=",1],["+","и "],["=",629]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["+","823 words is the figure usually quoted for the Louis-Philippe sentence (Part IV, Book 1, Chapter 3). A count of the French text in the Project Gutenberg edition gives about 760 words separated by spaces, or about 810 if elided forms such as \"l'histoire\" count as two words, so the exact number depends on the edition and the counting rule."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["+","823 Wörter ist die übliche Angabe für den Louis-Philippe-Satz (Teil IV, Buch 1, Kapitel 3). Zählt man den französischen Text der Project-Gutenberg-Ausgabe, kommt man auf etwa 760 durch Leerzeichen getrennte Wörter oder etwa 810, wenn elidierte Formen wie „l'histoire“ als zwei Wörter gelten – die genaue Zahl hängt also von Ausgabe und Zählweise ab."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["+","823 слова – обычно приводимая длина предложения о Луи-Филиппе (часть IV, книга 1, глава 3). Подсчёт французского текста в издании Project Gutenberg даёт около 760 слов, разделённых пробелами, или около 810, если считать формы с элизией вроде «l'histoire» двумя словами, так что точное число зависит от издания и способа подсчёта."]]}],"hash":"a4ad88f7fa46","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"23a2e74a379e0d464607c090370c85196d767d3cc2a0c7db546bfaba83d13f26"},
